{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Alien Shooters: Transform Your Home Into an Interdimensional Battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle waves of challenging invaders with high-tech laser weapons in this thrilling solo adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/extras/39003268_935001671827401_705030485960321023_n.png?t=1745298718\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Virutal Reality Magic</strong> \u2013 Portals open, blending real-world environments with virtual enemies and cosmic battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> \u2013 Use laser-equipped weapons to take down enemies, dodge laser beams, and survive escalating waves of attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Unlock and upgrade four unique weapons, including a revolver, tommy gun, grenade launcher, and shotgun, all enhanced with cutting-edge laser technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perks and Bonuses</strong> \u2013 Customize your gameplay with powerful perks and earn bonus points to climb the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Waves</strong> \u2013 Tackle 40+ levels of increasing difficulty, featuring flying enemies, asteroid strikes, and laser-shooting foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Compete with players worldwide for the highest score in single-session gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Enemy Design</strong> \u2013 Each enemy is uniquely animated, adding to the thrill as they flutter, zoom, and attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/extras/39031407_2838179409695399_726397580058907720_n.png?t=1745298718\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499170?t=1745298718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745298718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/35e2f00aa9be907ad78b12944ddbc6919012f02e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745298718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/35e2f00aa9be907ad78b12944ddbc6919012f02e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745298718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Alien Shooters: Transform Your Home Into an Interdimensional Battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle waves of challenging invaders with high-tech laser weapons in this thrilling solo adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499170/extras/39003268_935001671827401_705030485960321023_n.png?t=1745298718\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Virutal Reality Magic</strong> \u2013 Portals open, blending real-world environments with virtual enemies and cosmic battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> \u2013 Use laser-equipped weapons to take down enemies, dodge laser beams, and survive escalating waves of attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Unlock and upgrade four unique weapons, including a revolver, tommy gun, grenade launcher, and shotgun, all enhanced wi